# The build context of both browser images is browser/ (chrome/Dockerfile and
# camoufox/Dockerfile): each copies keeper/, desktop/ and its own directory.
# Nothing built or cached locally, and no tests, reaches an image.
**/*.md
*/.venv
**/__pycache__
*/.pytest_cache
*/profiles
*/tests
keeper/keeper
keeper/*_test.go
keeper/testdata
